updates-title = Updates
updates-auto-check = Automatically check for updates
updates-auto-check-help = Check on startup and every 24 hours. Installation starts only when you choose to update.
updates-proxy = HTTP proxy
updates-proxy-help = For update checks and downloads only. Example: http://127.0.0.1:7890. Leave blank for a direct connection; proxy authentication is not supported.
updates-invalid-proxy = Enter an HTTP or HTTPS proxy address without credentials, paths, or query parameters, such as http://127.0.0.1:7890.
updates-current-version = Current version: { $version }
updates-check = Check for updates
updates-checking = Checking for updates…
updates-idle = Updates are downloaded from GitHub Releases.
updates-current = You are running the latest stable version.
updates-available = Version { $version } is available.
updates-install = Download and install
updates-downloading = Downloading… { $percent }%
updates-verifying = Verifying the update…
updates-installing = Installing the update…
updates-installed = Version { $version } is installed. Restart RustTerm to use it.
updates-restart = Restart RustTerm
updates-cancel = Cancel download
updates-cancelling = Cancelling the download…
updates-cancelled = Update cancelled.
updates-releases = View releases
updates-unmanaged = Install an official .deb package or use install.sh from a .tar.gz release to enable in-app updates.
updates-debian-help = Installing a .deb update requests system administrator authorization. APT handles the upgrade and its dependencies.
updates-auth-cancelled = Administrator authorization was cancelled. The update was not installed.
updates-auth-unavailable = Could not obtain administrator authorization. Ensure pkexec and a desktop authentication agent are available, then try again.
updates-no-release = No public stable release was found. Please try again after a release is published.
updates-rate-limit = GitHub has temporarily limited requests. Please try again later.
updates-failed = Update failed: { $error }
updates-busy-exit = An update is being installed. Wait for installation to finish before quitting.
updates-save-before-restart = Save or discard your settings changes before restarting.
updates-restart-help = Restarting closes running sessions. Your normal exit confirmation will appear.

updates-windows-portable = To update the Windows portable edition, download the new ZIP from Releases and replace the extracted folder after closing RustTerm.
